## Area Detection Rules

Edit this table to match the domains of your life. Each row maps keywords or context cues to an area tag that Virgil uses when filing tasks.

| Keywords / context | Area |
|---|---|
| work, project-name, colleague-names | 💼 Work |
| family, partner-name, kids names | 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Family |
| house, repair, garden, plumber | 🏠 Home |
| career, CV, job application, networking | 💼 Career |
| personal, self, health, admin | 🧑 Personal |
| **No clear match → leave Area blank** | |

Replace these rows with the areas in your own life. Add as many as you need.

